{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_066B30","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"可是……冷战究竟真的是一场战争，还是一种和平……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"老实说，我也不知道。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"博士……？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"世人都称它为“冷战”。但我觉得不是这样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"核武器确实越来越多、威力越来越强，美苏拥有了足以把人类毁灭几十次的力量。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"但实际上，并没有人因此被杀。当然，小规模冲突和代理战争之类还是发生过……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"核威慑避免了世界规模的大战，和过去相比，世界迎来了压倒性的和平。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"而且，因为两大阵营竞争，太空开发也得到了推进。这不是很了不起吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"不……没必要那么急着开发太空……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"进入太空也许是人类的梦想。但不顾一切的竞争制造了牺牲。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"……也许吧。航天机构确实不会把一切都公开……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"核开发也是一样。核试验造成了平民死亡，也让很多人遭受辐射。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"没错……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"还有这次的事件……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"我越来越搞不懂，自己一直想守护的“和平”究竟是什么了……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""}]}